To stream each completed, validated item of a generated list one at a time, use `Output.array()` with `streamText` and consume the `elementStream` property. Each item emitted is complete and validated against your element schema.

```ts
import { streamText, Output } from 'ai';
import { z } from 'zod';

const { elementStream } = streamText({
  model: 'openai/gpt-4o',
  output: Output.array({
    element: z.object({
      name: z.string(),
      class: z.string(),
      description: z.string(),
    }),
  }),
  prompt: 'Generate 3 hero descriptions for a fantasy role playing game.',
});

for await (const hero of elementStream) {
  console.log(hero); // Each hero is complete and validated
}
```

