Use `defaultSettingsMiddleware` when defining your model alias in a `customProvider`. This applies the settings to every call without repeating them.

Example:

```ts
import { customProvider, gateway, defaultSettingsMiddleware, wrapLanguageModel } from 'ai';

export const myProvider = customProvider({
  languageModels: {
    // Model alias with default settings:
    'my-alias': wrapLanguageModel({
      model: gateway('openai/gpt-4o'),
      middleware: defaultSettingsMiddleware({
        settings: {
          temperature: 0.7,
          providerOptions: {
            openai: {
              reasoningEffort: 'high',
            },
          },
        },
      }),
    }),
  },
  fallbackProvider: gateway,
});
```

Now every call using `my-alias` will automatically use temperature 0.7 and the specified provider options [1,4,8].

